{"product":{"id":7586743943233,"title":"ABBA CB04 12V 10W 3-CCT LED Puck Light - 900 Lumens","body_html":"\u003cp data-end=\"582\" data-start=\"288\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong data-end=\"345\" data-start=\"292\"\u003eABBA Lighting USA CB04 3CCT LED Driver Puck Light\u003c\/strong\u003e offers the perfect blend of versatility, performance, and modern design. With a sleek low-profile body and three built-in color temperature options, it’s ideal for under-cabinet lighting, display accents, office task lighting, and more.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"601\" data-start=\"584\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"601\" data-start=\"584\"\u003eKey Features\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1434\" data-start=\"603\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"770\" data-start=\"603\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"770\" data-start=\"605\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"643\" data-start=\"605\"\u003e3CCT Adjustable Color Temperature\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"646\" data-start=\"643\"\u003eEasily switch between 3000K (Warm White), 4000K (Neutral White), and 5000K (Cool White) to match your environment or task.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"945\" data-start=\"772\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"945\" data-start=\"774\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"809\" data-start=\"774\"\u003ePowerful Integrated LED Driver\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"812\" data-start=\"809\"\u003eNo need for external components—installation is simplified thanks to the integrated 10W LED driver for clean, reliable performance.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1092\" data-start=\"947\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1092\" data-start=\"949\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"974\" data-start=\"949\"\u003eBright and Efficient\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"977\" data-start=\"974\"\u003eEmits up to \u003cstrong data-end=\"1005\" data-start=\"991\"\u003e900 lumens\u003c\/strong\u003e while using just \u003cstrong data-end=\"1035\" data-start=\"1023\"\u003e10 watts\u003c\/strong\u003e of power. Save on energy without sacrificing brightness.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1284\" data-start=\"1094\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1284\" data-start=\"1096\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1121\" data-start=\"1096\"\u003ePremium Construction\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"1124\" data-start=\"1121\"\u003eBuilt from \u003cstrong data-end=\"1165\" data-start=\"1137\"\u003eheavy-duty cast aluminum\u003c\/strong\u003e for long-lasting durability and excellent heat dissipation. Available in \u003cstrong data-end=\"1274\" data-start=\"1239\"\u003eBlack, Brushed Nickel, or White\u003c\/strong\u003e finishes.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1434\" data-start=\"1286\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1434\" data-start=\"1288\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1319\" data-start=\"1288\"\u003eVersatile Mounting Options\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr data-end=\"1322\" data-start=\"1319\"\u003eCan be recessed or surface-mounted depending on your needs. Each unit includes a junction box for easy wiring.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1467\" data-start=\"1436\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1465\" data-start=\"1436\"\u003eTechnical Specifications\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1806\" data-start=\"1468\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1510\" data-start=\"1468\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1510\" data-start=\"1470\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1483\" data-start=\"1470\"\u003eMaterial:\u003c\/strong\u003e Heavy-Duty Cast Aluminum\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1558\" data-start=\"1511\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1558\" data-start=\"1513\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1524\" data-start=\"1513\"\u003eFinish:\u003c\/strong\u003e Black, Brushed Nickel, or White\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1591\" data-start=\"1559\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1591\" data-start=\"1561\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1571\" data-start=\"1561\"\u003ePower:\u003c\/strong\u003e 10W AC\/DC 12V LED\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1614\" data-start=\"1592\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1614\" data-start=\"1594\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1605\" data-start=\"1594\"\u003eLumens:\u003c\/strong\u003e 900 LM\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1670\" data-start=\"1615\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1670\" data-start=\"1617\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1639\" data-start=\"1617\"\u003eColor Temperature:\u003c\/strong\u003e 3CCT – 3000K \/ 4000K \/ 5000K\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1717\" data-start=\"1671\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1717\" data-start=\"1673\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1682\" data-start=\"1673\"\u003eSize:\u003c\/strong\u003e 4.80″ (Diameter) × 0.85″ (Depth)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1748\" data-start=\"1718\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1748\" data-start=\"1720\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1740\" data-start=\"1720\"\u003eCutout Diameter:\u003c\/strong\u003e 4.20″\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1779\" data-start=\"1749\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1779\" data-start=\"1751\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1764\" data-start=\"1751\"\u003eIncluded:\u003c\/strong\u003e Junction Box\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1806\" data-start=\"1780\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1806\" data-start=\"1782\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1797\" data-start=\"1782\"\u003eMaster Box:\u003c\/strong\u003e 24 pcs\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1824\" data-start=\"1808\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-end=\"1822\" data-start=\"1808\"\u003eIdeal For\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cul data-end=\"1975\" data-start=\"1825\"\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1859\" data-start=\"1825\"\u003e\n\u003cp data-end=\"1859\" data-start=\"1827\"\u003eUnder-cabinet kitchen lighting\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli data-end=\"1897\" data-start=\"1860\"\u003